# wear/man/robe_hang: the Robe's skirt to the ankles: clean vertical folds, a trimmed border over a solid outline, the
# shoes under it; it sways by whole rows, spreads over the striding legs, streams back in the run, folds on the lap
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY) drew the first; GARB-M (P2b wave 2) redrew it. Fitted to the man (STYLE_P2 22).
use person
body man
role garment robe
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10
# (z 10: over the shoe tips (legs/adult/loco/tips, z 9), so a foot lifted behind the hem stays under it)
sway 4
# (an elf stands a pixel taller in the legs: each view's stretch row doubles, so the hem still meets the shoes)

